      "content": "• Freeze–Thaw (Frost Wedging)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "qdid6yf",
      "content": "• Exfoliation (Onion Peeling)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
